// ============================================================================
// CANscope sample trace — 25 frames, 2 channels
// Load with sample.dbc to verify decoded signal values match inline comments.
//
// VERIFICATION: after loading this file + sample.dbc in CanScope:
//   1. FrameTable should show 25 frames across 2 channels
//   2. SignalTree should show 3 messages: EngineData, SteeringInfo, VehicleDynamics
//   3. Select a frame -> check decoded values match the expected values below
//   4. Timeline should span 0.0s ~ 1.2s
//
// DBC signal summary:
//   EngineData    (0x100):  EngineSpeed [rpm], CoolantTemp [degC]
//   SteeringInfo  (0x200):  SteeringAngle [deg], SteeringTorque [Nm]
//   VehicleDynamics(0x350): VehicleSpeed [km/h], BrakePressure [%], BrakeSwitch
// ============================================================================

