0.000000 1 350x Rx d 8 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; Speed=0km/h    Brake=0%  Switch=Off
0.050000 1 350x Rx d 8 07 D0 00 00 00 00 00 00 ; Speed=20km/h   Brake=0%  Switch=Off
0.100000 1 350x Rx d 8 0F A0 00 14 00 00 00 00 ; Speed=40km/h   Brake=20% Switch=Off
